00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:22.790
Without a map, without a compass...

00:23:18.090 --> 00:23:22.390
Yang:

00:23:18.090 --> 00:23:22.390
Goda Hozumi

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:27.880
...we set out on a voyage

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:37.230
Not a journey to find something that's already been found

00:23:29.470 --> 00:23:33.570
